   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISK review CODESRIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en granskning av intern styrning och kontroll i syfte att identifiera svagheter i CODESRIAs interna kapacitet f&#xf6;r att bidra till att st&#xe4;rka forskningsorganisationen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a review of internal management and control in order to identify weaknesses in CODESRIAs capacity for Sida to be able to support the research organisation to become more efficient and stronger.</narrative>
  </description>
